:sdx_leds_apply_plug:
> Apply saves the form into `/boot/config/plugins/synology-expansion/synology-expansion.cfg` (Unraid's `/update.php`) and runs `scripts/sdx-load leds`, which writes the two settings to the running driver and updates the LED lines of the checks above; nothing is reloaded. At the next boot the loader applies them again. Orange (fault) is not set here: the Synology Hardware plugin decides it from disk health.
:end
